       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-PAPER-TAPE-CHAD.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PAPER-TAPE-CHAD-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CHAD-SHEARING-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STROBE-ALIGN-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CHUTE-CLEARING-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TAPE-LATENCY-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PAPER-TAPE-SEAL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-PAPER-TAPE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PTC-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PTC-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SHEAR-AND-STROBE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CHUTE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SHEAR-AND-STROBE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CHAD-SHEARING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STROBE-ALIGN-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-CHUTE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CHUTE-CLEARING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TAPE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CHAD-SHEARING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STROBE-ALIGN-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CHUTE-CLEARING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TAPE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-PAPER-TAPE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PTC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PTC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PTC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PTC-CODE.
